{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53335","headline":"诗偈 四十六 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫求佛兮莫求人，但自心里莫贪瞋。\n贪瞋痴病前顿尽，便是如来的的亲。\n内无垢兮外无尘，中间豁达无关津。\n神无障碍居三界，恰是琉璃处日轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}